STRING 2787
{
|cffd45e19LORE:|r The Island Fortress of Caer Darrow is an ancient Human Settlement that is believed to have been built in the days of Arator Empire, It was also the site where an ancient high elven runestone was placed, the Runestone and the Fortress are still maintained by Both Human and Elven Garrisons to this day.
}

